        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86725, Clear Glass Cabinet C-Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNew from Emtek, the Cabinet Crystal Pull is filled with transitional allure. This clear glass Cabinet C-Pull is made from kiln-fired molded glass with brass base mounts. Made with your modern kitchen in mind, the Clear Glass C-Pull can be easily matched to any color scheme in your kitchen. After all, clear goes with everything! The brass bases are available in a wide array of finish colors to match with your metal fixtures. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86725-specifications.gif?v=1704442294\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86725 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Glass Kitchen Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Clear Glass with Brass Base</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
